{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Landed as Gerrit change 3098, commit 73f2ca13433 (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1). Locally, make verify failed only the 17 known pandoc x86_64-on-arm64 tests, all under tests/unit/reconciler/ and none in the new module; Linux CI passed. The review bot's 2 advisories are about test strength: the comment test failed on unfixed code (it caught the add_comment call), and the inbound-only test is a deliberate control that passes before and after. Whether past bridge runs wrote inbound changes back to Jira is tracked separately in the linked P3 task."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792831721856640001,"uuid":"5a879c0b-443c-473b-99e5-d940a521b42d"}